@Indie_Goblin
The video looks very nice. Now, I don't know that language, but did you notice that they didn't give any examples of actually using text input to create dialog or make changes to the database?
I go back to my original response. Doing anything that requires a lot of typing would be torture. So if you don't plan on much dialog and you don't plan on changing much in the database then I guess...um...ok.

The in-game menu looks pretty nice for WITH and so does the cover art. Although it is just MZ for consoles like
@PikaFan64U
stated.
